      "off_mod_1": 0,
      "off_mod_2": 0,
      "origin": "Port Albatross",
      "passive_list": {
        "0": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "passive_description": "<table class=\"NormalTable\" style=\"height: 25px; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 123.596%;\" width=\"550\">\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">When you acquire this Quirk, describe the nature of your curse and tie it to one of the </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">threats </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">present in your world. </span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">Once this threat is resolved, you will finally have a chance to break free from the curse- describe how you expect this to happen.</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<table class=\"NormalTable\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"550\">\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">When you are about to perform a Check, you may instead describe how your curse gets in the way and automatically roll a </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">fumble </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">(both dice are treated as if you had rolled a </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">1 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">on them). </span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">If you do, you receive </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">2 Fabula Points </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">instead of 1, and generate<br>an </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">opportunity </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">as normal.</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<table class=\"NormalTable\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"550\">\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">If you ever manage to break the curse, immediately gain a Heroic Skill of your choice (you may even choose a Heroic Skill whose requirements you </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">do not </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">satisfy, unless they include a Skill you don't have). </span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">This includes choosing a Heroic Skill for a Class you do not have.</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><br><br></p>",
          "passive_name": "CURSED",
          "passive_roll": "",
          "passive_source": "quirk"
        },
        "1": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "passive_description": "<table class=\"NormalTable\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"505\"><span class=\"fontstyle0\">Once before the next rest, if the target is about to recover Mind Points, they may<br></span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">double </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">the amount of Mind Points recovered.</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
          "passive_name": "Pep Talk",
          "passive_roll": "",
          "passive_source": "camp activity"
        },
        "2": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "passive_description": "<table class=\"NormalTable\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"505\"><span class=\"fontstyle0\">Once before the next rest, you may perform an additional action on your turn during<br>a conflict scene. This action </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">must </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">be used to perform the </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">Equipment</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">, </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">Hinder</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">, or<br></span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">Inventory </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">action.</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
          "passive_name": "Sleep Soundly",
          "passive_roll": "",
          "passive_source": "camp activity"
        },
        "3": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "passive_description": "<table class=\"NormalTable\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"500\">\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">When you deal [</span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">dark]</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">, [</span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">earth]</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">, [</span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">ice]</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">, or [</span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">physical] </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">damage for the first time during a turn, you gain </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">1 Yin Point </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">and, if you have </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">at least 1 Yang Point</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">, you deal 5 extra damage.</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\"><br>When you deal </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">air</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">, </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">bolt</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">, </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">fire</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">, or </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">light </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">damage for the first time during a turn, you gain </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">1 Yang Point </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">and, if you have </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">at least 1 Yang Point</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">, you deal 5 extra damage.</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\"><br>At the end of your turn, if you have </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">3 or more Yin and/or Yang points </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">and have </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">at least 1 point of each type</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">, you lose all </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">Yin and Yang Points </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">and perform one of the<br>following effects based on the points you lost (perform </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">both </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">in case of a tie):</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\"><br></span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">Yin majority: </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">every enemy present on the scene loses an amount of Mind Points equal to</span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">【</span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">half your level</span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">】</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">.<br></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle2\">Yang majority: </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">one creature you can see that is present on the scene recovers an amount of Mind Points equal to</span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">【</span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">your level</span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">】</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">.<br></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">You may gain and use </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">Yin and Yang Points </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">only during conflicts, and you lose all your </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">Yin and Yang Points </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">at the end of each scene.</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
          "passive_name": "Kreislauf des Göttlichen und des Bösen [Disable till master 1 class]",
          "passive_roll": "",
          "passive_source": "heroic_skill"
        }
      },
