      "skill_list": {
        "0": {
          "$deleted": true,
          "class": "Chanter",
          "description": "<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">On your turn during a conflict scene, you may use an action and spend a variable<br>amount of MP to weave voice and music into a magical effect known as a </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">verse</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">.<br>You may only sing </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">one verse </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">per turn, even if you have access to multiple actions; the full rules for </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">verses </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">can be found starting on the next page.<br>When you first acquire this Skill, you learn </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">all three volumes</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">, plus </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">one key </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">and </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">one tone </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">. Whenever you acquire this Skill again, you may learn </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">one key or<br>one tone </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">(your choice)</span> </p>",
          "level": "2",
          "roll": "",
          "skill_name": "MAGICHANT"
        },
        "1": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "class": "Esper",
          "description": "<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">At the start of your turn during a conflict, you may choose one ally who is able to hear you </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">or </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">one enemy you can see that is suffering from </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">dazed</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">, </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">enraged</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">, and/or </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">shaken</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">.<br></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">Until the start of your next turn, the chosen creature becomes your </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">focus</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">.</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\"><br>When your </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">focus </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">suffers damage or recovers Hit Points and/or Mind Points, you may have them suffer extra damage equal to</span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">【</span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">SL + the strength of your Bond towards them</span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">】 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">or recover additional HP and/or MP equal to</span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">【</span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">SL &times; (1 + the strength of your Bond towards them</span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">】</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">, respectively. You may use this effect only </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">once per turn</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">.</span></p>",
          "level": "1",
          "roll": "",
          "skill_name": "COGNITIVE FOCUS"
        },
        "2": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "class": "Chanter",
